Package: gnome-fences
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gnome-shell (>= 46), libgtk-4-1
Description: PecoFence-style desktop organizer for GNOME Shell
 Organizes desktop files, folders, URLs, and applications into movable,
 resizable, collapsible "fence" panels that sit directly above the wallpaper
 and below ordinary windows. Built with a small GNOME Shell extension and a
 native Rust/GTK4 application talking over session D-Bus.
